    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d468">

                <pb facs="1167" n="1053" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg1053"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source"> J.C.S. Files</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the British Chiefs of Staff</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">most secret</hi>
                        <lb/> C.C.S. 317/3</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quebec</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-08-23">23 August 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Equipping Allies, Liberated Forces and Friendly
                        Neutrals</hi>
                </p>
                <p>We agree with the recommendation of the United States Chiefs of Staff<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d468-f1"/> that the Combined Chiefs of Staff should approve at
                    once subparagraphs <pb facs="1168" n="1054" xml:id="pg1054"/> 10 <hi
                        rendition="#italic">a</hi> and <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi> of C.C.S.
                        317,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d468-f2"/> provided that the following is inserted
                    at the end of subparagraph <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>, “insofar as this does
                    not interfere with operations scheduled previous to <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Quadrant</hi>”.</p>
                <p>If you agree, we suggest that the necessary action should now be taken without
                    this matter again coming before the Combined Chiefs of Staff at <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Quadrant</hi>.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d468-f3"/>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d468-f1" n="1" xml:id="d468-f1-content">
                <p>See <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg1049">p. 1049</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d468-f2" n="2" xml:id="d468-f2-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg1031">p. 1031</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d468-f3" n="3" xml:id="d468-f3-content">
                <p>The question, however, did come up for discussion at the 115th Meeting of the
                    Combined Chiefs of Staff, August 23, 1943. See <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg939">p. 939</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
